Show less

Seniority level

Associate

Employment type

Full-time

Industries

IT Services and IT Consulting

Are you passionate about optimizing business processes and driving revenue growth through operational excellence?
Randstad Portugal is looking for a Revenue Operations Analyst to join an international project supporting our global client, SAP. In this role, you will play a pivotal part in streamlining Go-to-Market (GTM) strategy, enhancing operational efficiency, and empowering cross-functional teams with data-driven decision-making.

Location:
Lisbon, Portugal (Hybrid)

Key Responsibilities:

Drive Go-to-Market (GTM) Process Oversight: Manage key business processes and lead GTM operational workflows;
Cross-Functional Stakeholder Support: Act as a strategic partner to Customer Solution Managers, Partner teams, and Ecosystem leaders;
Operational Excellence & Scalability: Collaborate with Senior Leadership to simplify, standardize, and scale systems and operational frameworks;
Data-Driven Business Insights: Leverage data to increase operational visibility, contributing directly to revenue generation and profitability goals;
Continuous Transformation: Facilitate continuous improvement initiatives and support GTM transformation strategies across teams.

Qualifications & Experience:

Bachelor’s degree in Business, Economics, Management, or a related field (preferred);
5+ years of experience in Business Operations Analyst or Revenue Operations roles;
Strong business acumen and a solid understanding of corporate operations;
Advanced skills in Microsoft Excel and proficiency across MS Office tools;
Familiarity with reporting and analytics tools is considered a strong advantage;
Professional fluency in English (proficiency in French, Italian, or other European languages is a plus).

What We Offer:

High-Impact Project Stability: Long-term engagement embedded in a global technology leader;
Strong Corporate Culture: Join a recognized global leader in talent solutions with a collaborative and inclusive work environment;
Comprehensive Benefits Package: Includes health insurance coverage and daily meal allowance.

